        "op_hi": [
            "15%",
            "10%",
            "7.5%",
            "5%"
        ],
        "ans": "4",
        "solution": "<b>Solution (EN):</b><br>Total cost of items = ₹25,000.<br>Cost of 1/5th of the items = 1/5 &times; 25000 = ₹5,000.<br>He sold this part at a 20% loss.<br>Loss incurred = 20% of 5000 = ₹1,000.<br>Cost of the remaining items = 25000 &minus; 5000 = ₹20,000.<br>To have neither overall gain nor loss, he must recover this exact ₹1,000 loss on the remaining items.<br>Required gain percentage on the remaining items = (1000 / 20000) &times; 100 = 5%.<br><br><b>Solution (HI):</b><br>सामानों की कुल लागत = ₹25,000.<br>1/5 भाग की लागत = 1/5 &times; 25000 = ₹5,000.<br>उसने इस हिस्से को 20% हानि पर बेचा।<br>उठाई गई हानि = 5000 का 20% = ₹1,000.<br>शेष सामानों की लागत = 25000 &minus; 5000 = ₹20,000.<br>कुल मिलाकर न लाभ और न हानि के लिए, उसे शेष वस्तुओं पर इस ₹1,000 की हानि की भरपाई करनी होगी।<br>शेष वस्तुओं पर आवश्यक लाभ प्रतिशत = (1000 / 20000) &times; 100 = 5%.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b><br>Using allegation method on portions:<br>1 part at -20% and 4 parts at x%. Overall 0%.<br>1 &times; (-20) + 4 &times; (x) = 5 &times; 0<br>4x = 20 &rArr; x = 5%."
