        "difficulty": "Hard",
        "q_en": "The LCM of 2<sup>3</sup> &times; 7<sup>2</sup> &times; 14, 2<sup>2</sup> &times; 14<sup>2</sup> &times; 18 and 7<sup>3</sup> &times; 14<sup>2</sup> &times; 18<sup>2</sup> is",
        "q_hi": "2<sup>3</sup> &times; 7<sup>2</sup> &times; 14, 2<sup>2</sup> &times; 14<sup>2</sup> &times; 18 और 7<sup>3</sup> &times; 14<sup>2</sup> &times; 18<sup>2</sup> का लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (LCM) क्या है?",
