        "solution": "<b>Solution (EN):</b><br>Let the number be n.<br>According to the question:<br>n<sup>2</sup> - 35<sup>2</sup> = 144<br>We know that 35<sup>2</sup> = 1225<br>n<sup>2</sup> - 1225 = 144<br>n<sup>2</sup> = 1225 + 144<br>n<sup>2</sup> = 1369<br>n = &radic;1369<br>n = 37<br><br>Now, we need to find the value of 2n - 10:<br>= 2 &times; 37 - 10<br>= 74 - 10<br>= 64<br><br><b>Solution (HI):</b><br>माना संख्या n है।<br>प्रश्नानुसार:<br>n<sup>2</sup> - 35<sup>2</sup> = 144<br>हम जानते हैं कि 35<sup>2</sup> = 1225<br>n<sup>2</sup> - 1225 = 144<br>n<sup>2</sup> = 1225 + 144<br>n<sup>2</sup> = 1369<br>n = &radic;1369<br>n = 37<br><br>अब, हमें 2n - 10 का मान ज्ञात करना है:<br>= 2 &times; 37 - 10<br>= 74 - 10<br>= 64<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b><br>35<sup>2</sup> = 1225.<br>Adding 144 to it gives 1369.<br>Since 1369 ends in 9 and is between 35<sup>2</sup> (1225) and 40<sup>2</sup> (1600), the number must be 37.<br>Required value = 2 &times; 37 - 10 = 74 - 10 = 64."
