        "q_en": "Study the given table and answer the question that follows.<br>The table depicts the number of cricket bats sold by five stores A, B, C, D and E in five consecutive years.<br> <span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjx4wnPfJY0cpGlsr2eSAxgvKjaToPVt4htibXorudRRDHEcggA-jZr5QQrCKdAe2zGojDzKTFKMECHWn-MQgJxhDJa0bkfAsm45Uu9pm7PuntEPp_qoEVjaYSn1yoaD3nfn2LAlTgbQ8zI5I0wDVnQqfWrPCFQGBI-1YhZoed9QyqXKVvsJXss-rhQB7A=rw\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\"></span></span></span><br>What is the difference between the number of bats sold by stores A and C together in 2019 and the number of bats sold by the stores B and E together in 2023?<span style=\"color: white;\">2437</span>",
